<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="4" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>CRM & Automation</h3><p>Lead routing, follow-up and lifecycle stages your team can use.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button>
<button type="button" class="saas-service" data-service="5" aria-pressed="false"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◈</span><h3>Pipeline Measurement</h3><p>Review qualified leads, demos, opportunities and verified outcomes.</p><span class="saas-service-more">Explore capability ↗</span></button></div><div class="saas-service-panel" aria-live="polite"><div><span id="saas-service-label">CAPABILITY 01 / SEARCH INTENT</span><h3 id="saas-service-title">Turn relevant search intent into pipeline.</h3><p id="saas-service-body">Build useful pages around buyer problems, product categories and evaluation questions. Measure qualified organic demand, not just impressions.</p></div><a href={booking} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discuss this capability ↗</a></div></div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-light" id="practices"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">01 / GROWTH MODEL FIT</p><h2>Different SaaS models. Different paths to growth.</h2></div><p>Not every signup is a sales lead. Select a model to explore how acquisition, qualification and measurement should change.</p></div><div class="ed-program-grid"><div class="ed-program-options" role="group" aria-label="SaaS business models"><button class="ed-program active" data-program="sales" aria-pressed="true"><span>01 / SALES-LED B2B</span><strong>Sales-Led SaaS</strong><small>Qualified demos and opportunities</small></button>
