<section class="ed-section ed-navy" id="intake"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">02 / FROM DISCOVERY TO PIPELINE</p><h2>A lead isn't a sales opportunity.</h2></div><p>Explore how a connected SaaS acquisition journey turns interest into meaningful evaluation and qualified pipeline.</p></div><div class="ed-journey"><div class="ed-steps" role="group" aria-label="SaaS acquisition stages"><button class="ed-step active" data-stage="0" aria-pressed="true"><span>01</span><strong>Attract</strong></button>
