<button class="ed-step " data-stage="5" aria-pressed="false"><span>06</span><strong>Opportunity</strong></button></div><div class="ed-stage-detail" aria-live="polite"><span id="ed-stage-kicker">STAGE 01 / ATTRACT</span><h3 id="ed-stage-title">Reach people researching software problems and solutions.</h3><p id="ed-stage-body">SEO, high-intent search campaigns and helpful product content make your business discoverable.</p><div class="ed-stage-metric"><span>WHAT TO REVIEW</span><strong id="ed-stage-metric">Relevant search visits and engaged buyers</strong></div></div></div>
<div class="saas-booking-row"><a class="ed-btn ed-btn-gold" href={booking}>Improve your SaaS lead-to-opportunity journey ↗</a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="ed-section ed-cream" id="automation"><div class="ed-wrap"><div class="ed-heading"><div><p class="ed-eyebrow">03 / LEAD LIFECYCLE &amp; CRM</p><h2>Don't lose a strong prospect between signup and sales.</h2></div><p>Capture useful intent, route inquiries, provide timely follow-up and keep the pipeline understandable.</p></div><div class="ed-automation-grid"><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">⌘</span><h3>Demo &amp; trial forms</h3><p>Capture the details your team needs without adding unnecessary friction.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">◉</span><h3>Lead qualification</h3><p>Use role, company fit, use case and product signals to support human decisions.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">↺</span><h3>Lifecycle follow-up</h3><p>Connect opt-in messaging, nurturing and handoff across the buying journey.</p></article><article tabindex="0"><span class="ed-capability-icon">▣</span><h3>CRM &amp; reporting</h3><p>Keep lead sources, meeting stages and qualified opportunities connected.</p></article></div><div class="ed-automation-demo"><div class="ed-demo-top"><span>DEMO REQUEST / CONCEPT WORKFLOW</span><i>ILLUSTRATIVE</i></div><div class="ed-chat"><p class="ed-chat-user">We're evaluating software for a 40-person operations team. Can we schedule a demo?</p><p class="ed-chat-bot">Thanks. I can record your product interest and preferred time, then route the request to the appropriate team for review and scheduling.</p></div><p>Example only. No live AI agent, CRM routing or confirmed meeting is represented.</p></div>
<div class="saas-booking-row"><a class="ed-btn ed-btn-gold" href={booking}>Discuss your SaaS CRM and lifecycle automation ↗</a></div>
</div></section>

